              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "ConniefrmCalgary"
            },
            "reviewBody": "It was easy to make - and really tasty. Served with rice and french beans.\n\nThe only suggestion I can make is I would cut back a tiny bit on the lemon juice (I had a pretty large lemon - maybe a smaller one would work better) \n\nDefinitely will make it again.",
